Messages.Body:
@Jorge: you're a very good player. Also, the only one I did not have a chance to play with before that tournament, which might explain the tension that might have occured then. Everything is fine for me and I congratulate you again with your last chance qualifier win with a very nice deck.

@everybody: for those who like good stories, reversal of fortunes in-and-out of games, and tournament reports, my next blog article will be a complete report of French championship. Probably around when the decklists will be out but I will need time to write it in French and English
remember the blog URL: ttcmaster.blogspot.fr

